@startuml
title 架构三：Redis 锁 + 计数器（不可靠方案）

node "业务服务实例" {
    component "Semaphore Logic"
    component "Redis Lock"
}

node "Redis" {
    database "Counter\n(currentPermits)"
}

"Semaphore Logic" --> "Redis Lock" : SETNX / DEL
"Semaphore Logic" --> "Counter\n(currentPermits)" : INCR / DECR

note right of "Counter\n(currentPermits)"
- 无 permitId
- 无 TTL
- 无法区分持有者
end note

note bottom of "Semaphore Logic"
异常 / 崩溃 / 超时
=> DECR 不执行
=> 计数永久失真
end note
@enduml
